    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This beautiful apartment is in the center of Clonee village and within a 5 minute walk of all shops and amenities.\nThe apartment is in a quiet gated and secure apartment complex. It is an own door apartment, with one main double bedroom with a double bed and built in wardrobes, a large sitting room and a good size kitchen.\nThere are 2 balconies, one is just off the sitting room which overlooks the river and other balcony is to the front of the apartment.\nThe apartment will be available from the middle of October."
